---
title: "first_blood_pot (Sherlock Watsons)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_reserve: first_blood_pot = total_payouts * 0.03
    q_reserve --> q_iter_issues: for each valid issue family
    q_iter_issues --> q_find_first: identify first submitter by last-modification timestamp
    q_find_first --> q_get_severity: determine severity of issue
    q_get_severity --> q_count_dups: n = number of submissions in issue family
    q_count_dups --> q_calc_shares: shares = severity_factor * (0.9 ^ (n - 1)) / n
    q_calc_shares --> q_assign_first: assign shares to first submitter only
    q_assign_first --> q_iter_issues: next issue family
    q_iter_issues --> q_total_shares: all issues processed, sum total shares
    q_total_shares --> q_distribute: for each first submitter
    q_distribute --> q_payout: submitter_payout = (submitter_shares / total_shares) * first_blood_pot
    q_payout --> q_distribute: next submitter
    q_distribute --> [*]: all first blood payouts distributed

    note right of q_reserve
        INV-001: First blood pot = 3% of total contest payouts
    end note

    note right of q_find_first
        INV-002: First submitter determined by last-modification timestamp on GitHub issue
        INV-003: Evaluated across all issues within a valid issue family
    end note

    note right of q_calc_shares
        INV-004: High severity factor = 5, Medium severity factor = 1
        INV-005: Formula = severity_factor * (0.9 ^ (n - 1)) / n
        INV-006: Solo findings yield maximum shares for first submitter
    end note
